  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Switching to Green &amp; Fair Fashion: Advancing sustainable production and consumption in cotton &amp; textile value chains in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective(s):To foster greener, low-carbon, resource-efficient, more circular/fairer cotton/textile value chains, that contribute to sustainable economic prosperity and poverty reduction in India.Specific objective(s): (1) To develop/increase adoption of less polluting and more resource-efficient+circular processes and services by all actors along the textiles and cotton value chains and (2) To enable greater adoption of Environmental, Social &amp; Economic Sustainability Standards</narrative>
  </description>
